F0EDE8]\">Delivery.</span>\n      </h1>\n      \n      <p class=\"mt-7 text-lg text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-xl\">\n        Practical, developer-free live sessions on applying AI tools to project management, project controls, and delivery leadership.\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"mt-5 text-sm text-[#C0B89A] leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-[#C79A4E]/50 pl-4\">\n        No flight bookings, no hotel expenses, no days out of the office.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n        <a href=\"/sessions\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold bg-[#C79A4E] text-[#1A1D24] rounded transition-all duration-200 hover:brightness-110 hover:scale-[1.02]\">\n          View live sessions\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"/for-speakers\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold border border-[#2C2F38] text-[#F0EDE8] rounded hover:bg-[#2C2F38] transition-colors\">\n          Share your expertise\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n[MarqueeTicker]\n\n<section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-6 mb-16\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#C79A4E] uppercase mb-3\">\n          Upcoming Sessions\n        </p>\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#F0EDE8] leading-tight max-w-sm\">\n          Sessions in development.\n        </h2>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"/sessions\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-[#C79A4E] hover:text-[#C79A4E]/70 transition-colors\">\n        View all &rarr;\n      </a>\n    </div>\n    [SessionsList]\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-20 lg:py-24 bg-[#21242C]\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8\">\n    <div class=\"mb-16\">\n      <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#C79A4E] uppercase mb-3\">\n        Why DeliverIQ\n      </p>\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#F0EDE8] leading-tight max-w-2xl\">\n        Built for the way project professionals actually work.\n      </h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-6 md:gap-20 py-12 border-t border-[#2C2F38]\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\">\n          <span class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-[#C79A4E]/15 leading-none shrink-0 select-none\">01</span>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#F0EDE8] leading-tight pt-1\">Live, not recorded.</h3>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-base text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed self-center\">\n          Every session is live with real-time Q&A. Ask questions, challenge ideas, and learn alongside peers ΓÇö not just watch a video.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-6 md:gap-20 py-12 border-t border-[#2C2F38]\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\">\n          <span class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-[#C79A4E]/15 leading-none shrink-0 select-none\">02</span>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#F0EDE8] leading-tight pt-1\">Practical, not theoretical.</h3>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-base text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed self-center\">\n          No AI hype. No generic overviews. Every session is built around real project work ΓÇö the tools, tasks, and decisions you face every week.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-6 md:gap-20 py-12 border-t border-[#2C2F38] last:border-b\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\">\n          <span class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-[#C79A4E]/15 leading-none shrink-0 select-none\">03</span>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#F0EDE8] leading-tight pt-1\">Expert-led, peer-tested.</h3>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-base text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed self-center\">\n          Sessions are led by working professionals in project management, controls, and delivery ΓÇö people who use these tools in the field.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-start\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#C79A4E] uppercase mb-3\">FAQ</p>\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#F0EDE8] leading-tight\">Common questions.</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-[#8A8D96] mt-4 leading-relaxed\">Straight answers. No filler.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0 w-full\">\n        <details class=\"group py-5 border-t border-[#2C2F38] cursor-pointer\">\n          <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[#F0EDE8] hover:text-[#C79A4E] transition-colors font-medium\">\n            What is DeliverIQ?\n            <span class=\"text-[#C79A4E] font-bold\">&plus;</span>\n          </summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed\">\n            DeliverIQ is a live learning platform for project management, project controls, and delivery professionals. We host expert-led online sessions focused on applying AI to real project work ΓÇö with live Q&A and replay access.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group py-5 border-t border-[#2C2F38] cursor-pointer\">\n          <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[#F0EDE8] hover:text-[#C79A4E] transition-colors font-medium\">\n            Are sessions free to attend?\n            <span class=\"text-[#C79A4E] font-bold\">&plus;</span>\n          </summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed\">\n            Some sessions are free; others require registration. Pricing is shown on each session listing. Joining the notification list ensures you hear about upcoming sessions before registration fills.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group py-5 border-t border-[#2C2F38] cursor-pointer\">\n          <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[#F0EDE8] hover:text-[#C79A4E] transition-colors font-medium\">\n            How do I access replays?\n            <span class=\"text-[#C79A4E] font-bold\">&plus;</span>\n          </summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed\">\n            Replays of past sessions are available in the Replays section. Some replays are open access; others may require a one-time fee or registration.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group py-5 border-t border-[#2C2F38] cursor-pointer\">\n          <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[#F0EDE8] hover:text-[#C79A4E] transition-colors font-medium\">\n            Can I apply to speak at a DeliverIQ session?\n            <span class=\"text-[#C79A4E] font-bold\">&plus;</span>\n          </summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed\">\n            Yes. We actively invite practitioners to share their expertise. Visit the For Speakers page to learn about what we look for and submit an expression of interest.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group py-5 border-t border-[#2C2F38] cursor-pointer\">\n          <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[#F0EDE8] hover:text-[#C79A4E] transition-colors font-medium\">\n            How can my brand sponsor a session?\n            <span class=\"text-[#C79A4E] font-bold\">&plus;</span>\n          </summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed\">\n            Sponsorship opportunities are available for brands that want to reach project professionals. Visit the For Sponsors page for audience details and package options.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group py-5 border-t border-[#2C2F38] border-b cursor-pointer\">\n          <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-[#F0EDE8] hover:text-[#C79A4E] transition-colors font-medium\">\n            Is DeliverIQ only for project managers?\n            <span class=\"text-[#C79A4E] font-bold\">&plus;</span>\n          </summary>\n          <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-[#8A8D96] leading-relaxed\">\n            No. DeliverIQ is built for the full project delivery community ΓÇö project managers, project controls professionals, planners, schedulers, cost engineers, and delivery leaders.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"relative py-24 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden border-t border-[#2C2F38] bg-[#21242C]/20\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-[#F0EDE8] leading-tight mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n      Ready to bring AI into your project work?\n    </h2>\n    <p class=\"text-[#8A8D96] text-lg mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">\n      Join the list and be first to know when new sessions open for registration.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"flex justify-center gap-4\">\n      <a href=\"/sessions\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold bg-[#C79A4E] text-[#1A1D24] rounded hover:brightness-110 transition-all\">\n        Explore sessions\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>`,\n  sessionsPageHtml: `<section class=\"relative overflow-hidden pt-20 pb-16 lg:pt-28 lg:pb-20\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-3xl\">\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#C79A4E] uppercase mb-4\">\n        Live Sessions\n      </p>\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#F0EDE8] leading-tight mb-5\">\n 